{"docid": "sar-warner", "linkedin_slug": "sar-warner", "first_name": "Sar", "last_name": "Warner", "picture_url": "https://media.licdn.com/dms/image/v2/C4D03AQHQaiOmj3qYyA/profile-displayphoto-shrink_200_200/profile-displayphoto-shrink_200_200/0/1516515729573?e=2147483647&v=beta&t=e9IquG6U2tjPxy3VyqDiyUj0pjrTpOxyPJ38YS3YMlk", "title": "Chief of Staff at Patreon | Strategy 🔮, Operations ⚙️, Culture 🌎", "canonical_title": ["Chief Administrative Officer"], "summary": "👋 💁🏻‍♀️🌉 👶🏻

⬅️ I swore I'd never work a desk job; attending meeting after meeting, wearing starched, uncomfortable clothes, and sitting for hours at a time, all underneath a beige office umbrella felt like my version of hell. So when I found myself discontentedly bouncing from a job working on a lacrosse field, to a job in a Title I school, to a job at UC Berkeley, you can imagine my confusion. 

➡️ It turns out that I really love desk jobs; a well run meeting gives me deep satisfaction, I like putting on real pants on office days, I often get lost in thought for hours at a time doing deep focus work, and the buildings I've had the privilege of working in aren't beige at all. I never thought "desk jobs" could provide me the opportunities they have; improving collaboration and decision-making among leaders, planning and executing an $800K C-Suite event, helping an organization launch products more effectively, the list goes on. The common thread is developing individuals, teams, and organizations to be the best versions of themselves and Anthropic is the most interesting challenge yet. In many ways, I'm just getting started here, and I can't wait to see what happens. 🚀 💕", "inferred_languages": [{"language": "English", "proficiency": "C1"}], "location": "San Francisco Bay Area United States", "location_coordinates": {"lng": -122.3, "lat": 37.8}, "location_country_code": "US", "location_regions": ["Americas", "North America", "AMER"], "is_top_universities": true, "total_experience_years": 14.5, "estimated_age": 37.0, "profile_created_date": "2006-08-29", "expertise": ["get", "design", "across", "global onboarding", "organization", "surveys", "cross-functional", "strategic planning", "project management systems", "systems management", "creating programs", "learning specialist", "market analysis", "anthropic", "unified communications", "market research analyst", "program building", "academic coach", "leadership", "market research", "office software", "pipelines", "independent consulting", "launch", "pmo", "startups", "research analyst", "data-driven insights", "management", "communications", "wellness", "think tank", "sustainable growth", "executing", "project management", "support", "reports", "collaboration", "c", "development", "career development", "engineering", "drafting", "remote work", "leadership development", "research", "facilitating", "see", "framewo